## Summary

This folder highlights Softstack's public smart contract audit work for **XTON**, a TON ecosystem wallet and Web3 gateway.

It is a strong public reference for Softstack's ability to support **core smart contract security**, **TON ecosystem infrastructure**, and **user-facing blockchain products where security and trust are critical**.
